DDD7 20206F6B         (    forth6809.asm):02128         OKMSG:      FCC   "  ok"
     0004             (    forth6809.asm):02129         OKMSGL      EQU   *-OKMSG
DDDB 20204552524F5220 (    forth6809.asm):02130         ERRMSG:     FCC   "  ERROR "
