E1E8 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03017                     PSHU  D
E1EA BDE4F6           (    forth6809.asm):03018                     JSR   THROWW
                      (    forth6809.asm):03019         
E1ED 3710             (    forth6809.asm):03020         IDONE:      PULU  X                 ; c-addr from WORD (empty). See bugfix: INTERPRET.4
E1EF 39               (    forth6809.asm):03021                     RTS
