E5A5 CC0002           (    forth6809.asm):03803                     LDD   #TAGBACK
E5A8 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03804                     PSHU  D
E5AA 39               (    forth6809.asm):03805                     RTS
                      (    forth6809.asm):03806         
